# Resume assigned queue (#3605)

Always-on ticks must re-read discovered work. `fresh=0` is not idle when the resume queue is non-empty (`/tmp/lgfc-cursor-resume-queue.json`).

After a PR is opened, a HOLD is posted, or PACKAGE-INCOMPLETE is recorded, immediately continue the next eligible item:

1. Numbered Operations interrupts
2. Assigned open Issues
3. Open authored PRs with failing or pending gates
4. Cursor-owned `post-merge-failure`
5. `agent:cursor` + `status:active`

Do not mix remaining queue items into the just-opened PR. `handoff:ready` is not website Go. Do not self-merge.

Canonical: `docs/ops/ai/CORE-RULES.md` assigned-queue continuation.
